Z||000008||theogre||07-09-2001||08:18 PM||||I'd check the thing as discribed in my cave article.... There are multiple power and ground feed to the box. If the marked solder joints have cracked you can get all sorts of odd behavior.<p>[This message has been edited by theogre (edited 07-09-2001).]||||reg||1
